00:15:49,300 --> 00:15:52,060
我希望你们合得来
and I want you to get along.

355
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:54,490
我说的"爱"  对你是朋友之爱
And when I say "love," I meant as a friend.

356
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:58,780
咱俩之间说"爱"太快了  对吗
And, uh, way too soon, right?

357
00:15:59,630 --> 00:16:01,330
坐下吧  听我说  艾米莉
Okay, sit down. Listen, Emily,

358
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:02,860
我和拉杰的事
what happened between me and Raj

359
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:04,490
-已经是陈年旧事了  -没错
- was a long time ago. - It was,

360
00:16:04,490 --> 00:16:07,000
而且我也不该在这件事上小题大作
and I may have made it seem like a bigger deal than I should have.

361
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,580
现在莱纳德和我订婚了
Yeah, and Leonard and I are engaged now,

362
00:16:08,580 --> 00:16:11,460
我希望这事大家就既往不咎吧
and I'm just hoping we can put this whole thing behind us.

363
00:16:11,850 --> 00:16:13,290
我也希望这样
I'd like that, too.

364
00:16:13,290 --> 00:16:15,150
我本来以为我不会心里不舒服
Yeah, I thought I'd be okay with it,

365
00:16:15,150 --> 00:16:17,160
但结果看到你这么漂亮
but then I saw how pretty you are.

366
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,000
你嘴真甜
Oh, that's so sweet.

367
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,060
瞧你  这么美
I mean, look at you-- you are gorgeous.

368
00:16:21,060 --> 00:16:23,840
没错  你俩都美呆了
It's true-- you're both gorgeous.

369
00:16:24,850 --> 00:16:28,330
把这两朵娇花带上床的男人该有多优秀啊
Kind of says something about the man who could bed you both.

370
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:38,290
你明白为啥我大半辈子都孤单一人了吧
You get why I've been alone most of my adult life.

371
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:42,780
什么风把你们吹来了
So, what brings you by?

372
00:16:42,780 --> 00:16:45,990
我来这里不需要原因  这是我的房子
Well, I don't need a reason-- it's my house.

373
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,380
确切来说  这是你妈妈的房子  但是
Technically, it's your mom's house, but...

374
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:51,580
我们还是希望你能觉得自己是受欢迎的
we certainly want you to feel welcome.

375
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,170
我永远都受欢迎
I'm always welcome.

376
00:16:54,170 --> 00:16:57,590
只是  下次来之前先打个电话
Mm, just... try and call first.

377
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,980
好啦  我们说正事吧
Okay, let's get down to business.

378
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:02,910
华仔考虑投资一点钱
Howie was thinking about putting up some money

379
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:04,360
帮你重开漫画店
to help you reopen the store,

380
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:07,290
但在投资前  我有些问题要问
but before that happens, I have a few questions.

381
00:17:07,850 --> 00:17:08,990
我很感谢你的慷慨解囊
I appreciate the offer,

382
00:17:08,990 --> 00:17:12,320
但你妈妈已经给我钱了
but actually your mother already gave me the money.

383
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:15,350
什么
What?

384
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:18,540
是啊  我跟她说这太慷慨了
Yeah. I told her it was too much,

385
00:17:18,540 --> 00:17:21,870
但她说能帮她的小乖乖她很开心
but she said she was happy to help out her bubala.

386
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:25,280
失陪下
Excuse me.

387
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:28,510
妈  你赶紧取消支票
Ma, you are canceling that check,

388
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:31,200
斯图尔特不是你的小乖乖  我才是
and Stuart is not your bubala; I'm your bubala.

389
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:33,770
你怎能同时拥有两个小乖乖呢
You can't have more than one bubala!

390
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:35,930
我不知道他在冲谁嚷嚷
I don't know who he's talking to.

391
00:17:35,930 --> 00:17:38,740
他妈妈去百货店帮我买T恤了
She's at Target, buying me shirts.

392
00:17:41,770 --> 00:17:44,280
我真开心问题解决了
I'm so glad we could work this all out.

393
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:46,080
我也是
Yeah, me, too.

394
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:48,010
你和莱纳德改天晚上和我们一起吃饭吧
You know, we should have dinner one night with you and Leonard.

395
00:17:48,010 --> 00:17:49,290
我们太乐意了
Oh, we would love that.

396
00:17:49,290 --> 00:17:50,080
太棒了
Great!

397
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:53,340
-晚安了  两位  -好的  晚安
- Okay, good night, guys. - All right, night.

398
00:17:53,340 --> 00:17:54,840
拜
Bye.

399
00:17:55,490 --> 00:17:57,620
-我讨厌她  -我讨厌她
- I hate her. - I hate her.

400
00:18:02,690 --> 00:18:03,930
我真的很失望  我们不能开一家
I'm really disappointed we're not gonna have

401
00:18:03,930 --> 00:18:05,880
-自己的漫画书店  -是啊
- our own comic book store. - I know.

402
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,080
我本来满心期待
I was looking forward to it.

403
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:10,080
能开一家自己的漫画书店多好啊
It would've been so nice to have a place that was ours,

404
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:13,000
我们可以安静地坐着在里面看漫画书
where we could just sit and read comics in peace.

405
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,320
有舒服的座位
With comfy seats.

406
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,700
还有零食
And snacks.

407
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:17,940
唉  哪有这么好的事啊
Well, I guess it was too good to be true.

408
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:19,430
没错
Yeah.

